'''Eyewaltz '''is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] introduced in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]] gains [[Wave Attack|Wave Attacks]] and a slightly longer attack frequency. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

